IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INVENTORY-REQUESTER.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 REQUEST-TEXT PIC X(64) VALUE "INQUIRE WIDGET".
01 REPLY-TEXT PIC X(96).
SCREEN SECTION.
01 INVENTORY-SCREEN SIZE 20, 120.
05 FILLER AT 1, 2 VALUE "Pulse Pathway - durable inventory".
05 FILLER AT 3, 2 VALUE "Command:".
05 COMMAND-FIELD AT 3, 12 PIC X(64) USING REQUEST-TEXT.
05 FILLER AT 5, 2 VALUE "Reply:".
05 RESULT-FIELD AT 5, 12 PIC X(96) FROM REPLY-TEXT.
05 FILLER AT 8, 2 VALUE "INQUIRE WIDGET".
05 FILLER AT 9, 2 VALUE "RESERVE WIDGET 2 ORDER1".
05 FILLER AT 10, 2 VALUE "RELEASE ORDER1".
05 FILLER AT 12, 2 VALUE "Stock: WIDGET 100, SENSOR 25, RELAY 50 (initial values only)".
05 FILLER AT 14, 2 VALUE "Lost reply? Retry the saved request. Do not start a new reservation blindly.".
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
DISPLAY BASE INVENTORY-SCREEN.
ACCEPT INVENTORY-SCREEN.
SEND REQUEST-TEXT TO "inventory-service" REPLY CODE 0 YIELDS REPLY-TEXT.
DISPLAY INVENTORY-SCREEN.
STOP RUN.
